## The number nobody had computed

Ledger: 12 verdicts taken · 6 classifiable · 6 void.

• EARNED 6 · COULD_NOT_CHECK 6 · UNEARNED 0 · INCONCLUSIVE 0 · BASELINE_RED 0 · REGISTER_DRIFT 0

